    "  - *Entangled Collapse Engine (ECE)* uses SHA-256 lattice as a metaphor for an entangled system: it highlights that you don’t need the full state of a system to compute consequences, just the changes (deltas). This resonates with Feynman’s path integrals or certain quantum computing approaches where relative phases matter more than absolute states.\n",
