    "\n",
    "  - The **Δπ Synthesizer**: This notion of extracting Bailey–Borwein–Plouffe (BBP) formula digits of $\\pi$ on the fly to seed recursion at any scale is a very explicit cross-domain tool – it treats $\\pi$ as an infinite reservoir of pseudo-random but harmonic data that can be tapped at will (like a stream of truth to mix into a system). This connects computational mathematics (digit extraction algorithms) with physical process control (influencing a field by injection).\n",
