    "We explore the idea that SHA hashes are **not random locks**, but **fingerprints of multidimensional systems**. By applying mirror reflection to their structure — particularly in 4-bit blocks (nibbles) — we can reveal **stabilizing feedback loops**, which we define as **harmonic nonces**.\n",
