    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## Formula: Harmonic SHA Nonce\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "A harmonic nonce is defined as:\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "N = \\text{{ReverseNibbles}}(\\text{{SHA}}(x))\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "Then:\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "\\Delta S = | \\text{{Decimal}}(N) - \\text{{Decimal}}(\\text{{SHA}}(x)) |\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "This $\\Delta S$ represents the **internal stabilization pressure**.\n",
